# TALLY hackathon

- Submission = Flutter + Serverpod under `tally/` only. React `src/` is marketing.
- Unique job: deposit → lock night → today’s tally. No inventory/HR/barcode mega-POS.
- Judging: 30% works · 25% Serverpod · 25% craft · 20% useful (Partiful-verified).
- Organiser hero: real endpoints + generated client + Postgres persistence.
- Read `docs/memory/BUILD_SPEC.md` and `docs/memory/CHALLENGE_FACTS.md` before changing architecture.
- Fact-check with Tavily/TinyFish; never invent dates, stats, or APIs.
- Stage Bible may arrive later — do not invent it.
